sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Dev as Human dev
  participant RR as Record&Replay
  participant T as Thread/Session
  participant SM as SkillsManager
  participant U as User
  Dev->>Dev: write skills/foo/SKILL.md
  Dev->>RR: record session (optional)
  RR->>Dev: human distills draft
  Dev->>Dev: cargo test + git commit
  U->>T: $foo fix the build
  T->>SM: scan → metadata ≤2% ctx
  SM->>T: build_skill_injections(@mention)
  T->>U: turn uses full SKILL.md this turn only
  Note over T: no post-turn patch hook